  "description": "Update Power Apps fields in a smart and reactive way.\n\nReactive Fields Updater is an XrmToolBox tool to change field properties (MaxLength, MinValue, MaxValue) of Dataverse / Dynamics 365 entities in bulk:\n- Filter and sort entities and fields\n- Edit the new value next to the current one, with validation while typing\n- Collect the changes as a list of operations, across many fields and entities\n- Apply the selected operations in one go, optionally publishing the entities afterwards\nSupports Text, Multiline Text, Whole Number, Decimal, Floating Point and Currency fields.",
