  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0\n- New: filter boxes and sortable columns for Entities and Fields.\n- New: Attributes grid with Current Value / New Value and input validation.\n- New: support for Multiline Text, Decimal, Floating Point and Currency fields.\n- New: \"Publish after update\" option, confirmation before updating and summary afterwards.\n- New: Del / Ctrl+A in the Operations list; new operations are checked by default.\n- New: entities loaded automatically; reset on connection change; confirmation when closing with pending operations.\n- Improved: metadata cache and a single request per field, with progress messages.\n- Fixed: error when clearing the Attributes grid; check state lost when adding operations; failed operations removed from the list; operations shared among tool instances; settings not saved.\n\n1.1.4\n- Introduced Responsive UI.",
